<para id="X394000010K00QJ" category="J" type-id="3029D" name-id="73265-00" from="200612" to="200912">
<dtccode/>
<dtcname>ETC system does not function</dtcname>
<subpara id="X394000010K00QJ_10" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X394000010K00QJ_11" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="X394000010K00QJ_11_0008" proc-id="RM0550J___0000B5U00000">
<testtitle>Inspect with ETC On-board Unit Tester</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Inspect with ETC On-board Unit Tester</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E122082J03" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using an ETC on-board unit tester, check whether the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly is performing wireless communication normally.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Abnormal operation</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Normal operation</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Operate the ETC on-board unit tester at a point approx. 1 m from the windshield in the vehicle's forward direction from the navigation antenna assembly, at 23° ± 15° to the horizontal. (The distance between the ETC on-board unit tester and the antenna is only a guide)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Point the communication surface of the ETC on-board unit tester toward the navigation antenna assembly.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Do not bring the ETC on-board unit tester too close to the navigation antenna assembly, as communication with the tester may be established even if the antenna is disconnected.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X394000010K00QJ_11_0003" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="X394000010K00QJ_11_0001" fin="false">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X394000010K00QJ_11_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___0000B5R00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Area Around Antenna</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Inspect Area Around Antenna</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Inspect for obstructions around the navigation antenna assembly (top surface of the instrument panel).</ptxt>
<spec>
<subtitle>Specified Condition</subtitle>
<specitem>
<ptxt>No obstructions</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Inspect whether any film, stickers, etc. are applied to the windshield glass.</ptxt>
<spec>
<subtitle>Specified Condition</subtitle>
<specitem>
<ptxt>No film or stickers</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X394000010K00QJ_11_0034" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="X394000010K00QJ_11_0014" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X394000010K00QJ_11_0034" proc-id="RM0550J___0000B6100000">
<testtitle>Inspect Toll Collection Antenna Wire (Installation Condition)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Toll Collection Antenna Wire Installation Condition Inspection</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Inspect the toll collection antenna wire cord for installation problems such as sharp bends or pinching.</ptxt>
<spec>
<subtitle>Specified Condition</subtitle>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Installation normal</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Resistance Inspection</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Disconnect the connector shown in the illustration that is connected to the navigation antenna assembly.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E101146J03" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Disconnect the connector shown in the illustration that is connected to the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E101146J03" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance of the toll collection antenna wire between the navigation antenna assembly and the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.25in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.25in"/>
<colspec colname="COL4" colwidth="1.63in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Core wire - Core wire</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 5 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Shield - Shield</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 5 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X394000010K00QJ_11_0028" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="X394000010K00QJ_11_0033" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X394000010K00QJ_11_0028" proc-id="RM0550J___0000B6000000">
<testtitle>Inspect Navigation Antenna Assembly</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Navigation Antenna Assembly Installation Condition Inspection</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Inspect the navigation antenna assembly cord for installation problems such as sharp bends or pinching.</ptxt>
<spec>
<subtitle>Specified Condition</subtitle>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Installation normal</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Resistance Inspection</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E122225J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<test2>
<ptxt>Disconnect the navigation antenna assembly connector connected to the toll collection antenna wire.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the core wire and shield terminals of the connector.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.71in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.03in"/>
<colspec colname="COL4" colwidth="1.39in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Core wire - Shield</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 10 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X394000010K00QJ_11_0029" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="X394000010K00QJ_11_0030" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X394000010K00QJ_11_0029">
